<div class="philosophy-wrap">
  <div class="philosophy-inner philosophy">
    <div>
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Our philosophy</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">No bias.<br>Just science.</h2>
      <p class="philosophy-body">Most ingredient apps use <strong>proprietary scores</strong> built on cherry-picked studies, animal data at non-human doses, and fringe research. They alarm you to keep you engaged.</p>
      <p class="philosophy-body">Peel only flags ingredients based on <strong>strong scientific consensus</strong> — human evidence, EU EFSA regulatory classifications, and IARC carcinogen data. If the consensus says it's safe, Peel says it's safe.</p>
      <p class="philosophy-body">When we do flag something, we tell you <strong>exactly why</strong> — the classification, the source, and the evidence behind it.</p>
      <div class="philosophy-quote">"We show you <em>why</em> something is flagged —<br>not just that it is."</div>
    </div>

